@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title +1 场景视图：统一接入与亿级元数据检索

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor "Gravitino\n生态客户端" as gravitino
actor "Iceberg\n生态客户端" as iceberg
actor "内部产品 / 用户" as internal
actor "平台管理员" as admin

rectangle "统一元数据平台" {
  usecase "UC1 协议兼容接入\n创建 / 更新 / 查询元数据" as UC1
  usecase "UC2 层级导航\ncatalog → schema → dataset/table" as UC2
  usecase "UC3 精确查询\nID / name / owner" as UC3
  usecase "UC4 文本与全文检索\n属性 / 注释 / 描述 / 文档" as UC4
  usecase "UC5 标签筛选\nkey:value + 对象关系" as UC5
  usecase "UC6 自定义 Key 查询\n动态模板受控扩展" as UC6
  usecase "UC7 索引治理\nKey 准入 / 配额 / 容量 / 重建" as UC7
}

gravitino --> UC1
gravitino --> UC2
iceberg --> UC1
iceberg --> UC2
internal --> UC1
internal --> UC2
internal --> UC3
internal --> UC4
internal --> UC5
internal --> UC6
admin --> UC7

UC1 .> UC7 : 元数据变更触发索引更新
UC6 .> UC7 : 新 Key 需经过治理

note bottom of UC3
目标规模：亿级元数据
目标时延：秒级检索
具体 P95/P99、并发量待压测后定稿
end note

note bottom of UC7
Mapping Key 达上限时：
拒绝继续动态映射，冷 Key 降级为固定 KV 结构；
不影响已有索引和基础查询
end note
@enduml
